---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="¡Gracias por tu consulta! | Padilla Peritaciones"
  description="Hemos recibido tu consulta. Nos pondremos en contacto contigo en menos de 2 horas."
  conversion={true}
  noindex={true}
>

<style>
  :root {
    --primary: #226D94;
    --primary-dark: #1a5878;
    --primary-light: #2f82b0;
    --primary-xlight: #e8f4f9;
    --bg: #ffffff;
    --bg-alt: #f4f8fb;
    --text: #0f1e2e;
    --text-muted: #5c7080;
    --border: #dce8f0;
    --radius: 16px;
    --radius-lg: 24px;
    --shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(34,109,148,0.12);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: var(--bg-alt); color: var(--text); min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 40px 24px; }

  .gracias-card {
    background: white;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 60px 48px;
    max-width: 540px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .gracias-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light));
  }

  .gracias-icon { font-size: 72px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1; }
  .gracias-title {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: var(--text);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .gracias-text {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .gracias-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 16px 32px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.25s;
    font-family: inherit;
  }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--primary); color: white; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(34,109,148,0.3); }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .btn-secondary { background: white; color: var(--primary); border: 2px solid var(--primary); }
  .btn-secondary:hover { background: var(--primary-xlight); transform: translateY(-2px); }

  .gracias-trust {
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .trust-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .trust-item svg { color: var(--primary); }

  .logo-wrap {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .logo-wrap img { height: 40px; width: auto; }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .gracias-card { padding: 40px 24px; }
    .gracias-title { font-size: 26px; }
  }
</style>

<div class="gracias-card">
  <div class="logo-wrap">
    <img src="/img/logo-negro.png" alt="Padilla Peritaciones" />
  </div>
  <div class="gracias-icon">✅</div>
  <h1 class="gracias-title">¡Consulta enviada!</h1>
  <p class="gracias-text">
    Hemos recibido tu mensaje correctamente. <strong>José Ángel Padilla</strong> se pondrá en contacto contigo en menos de 2 horas en horario laboral.
  </p>
  <div class="gracias-actions">
    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">
      Volver al inicio
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="gracias-trust">
    <div class="trust-item">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
      Respuesta en &lt; 2 horas
    </div>
    <div class="trust-item">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
      Perito acreditado APCAS
    </div>
    <div class="trust-item">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
      Sin compromiso
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</Layout>
